{"4145830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cocommando", "steam_appid": 4145830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cocommando is a young cock. Until quite recently he lives peacefully in his own hen-roost with other hens and his beloved. However, last events have disrupted this idyll. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gang of Foxes - kidnappers invade and assaulted the hen-roost and kidnapped hens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cocommando was miraculously saved by old Drake, well-known hermit living no the edge of forest. This Drake helped our cock, pulled him out from hen-roost and hid in own house. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During their escape from hen-roost, they found lost by kidnappers map. There are marked hiding-places of kidnappers. With this map they can localize kidnapped hens. Among kidnapped hens is beloved girl of our cock. He decides that he rescues kidnapped hens and, of course, his sweetheart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He will do it with the help of Drake. This old Drake becomes the good friend of cock, trains him, equips him with weaponry. Drake’s shed becomes their command centre. From this place begins every mission. Here Drake locates kidnappers’ hiding-places and from here Cocommando starts to his actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before starting each mission we are in shed and we see Drake, who gives us information about goals of mission and shows us the map. After it camera closes to the map and next mission begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cocommando must free his beloved!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full 3D: objects, animations, lights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original, fabulously colorful graphics, each stage in a different world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 main levels and 10 hidden bonus levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various worlds, including: Egyptian pyramids, the desert of the Wild West, a go-kart race, a river, an ice land, underground channels, a planet of foxes, a coast with a lighthouse, a crazy roller coaster, underground channels, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced and dynamic action requiring determination and cunning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multitude of funny weapons, e.g. egg grenade launcher, match crossbow, water pistol, spring-loaded glove... and many, many other inventions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of humor, plot twists, and surprising surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natural and artificial obstacles: water, swamps, lava, pits, traps, platforms...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and opponents of all kinds, including bosses at the end of each stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse objectives for each mission, but one main task: free your beloved!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cocommando is a young cock. Until quite recently he lives peacefully in his own hen-roost with other hens and his beloved. However, last events have disrupted this idyll. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gang of Foxes - kidnappers invade and assaulted the hen-roost and kidnapped hens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cocommando was miraculously saved by old Drake, well-known hermit living no the edge of forest. This Drake helped our cock, pulled him out from hen-roost and hid in own house. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During their escape from hen-roost, they found lost by kidnappers map. There are marked hiding-places of kidnappers. With this map they can localize kidnapped hens. Among kidnapped hens is beloved girl of our cock. He decides that he rescues kidnapped hens and, of course, his sweetheart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He will do it with the help of Drake. This old Drake becomes the good friend of cock, trains him, equips him with weaponry. Drake’s shed becomes their command centre. From this place begins every mission. Here Drake locates kidnappers’ hiding-places and from here Cocommando starts to his actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before starting each mission we are in shed and we see Drake, who gives us information about goals of mission and shows us the map. After it camera closes to the map and next mission begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cocommando must free his beloved!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full 3D: objects, animations, lights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original, fabulously colorful graphics, each stage in a different world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 main levels and 10 hidden bonus levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various worlds, including: Egyptian pyramids, the desert of the Wild West, a go-kart race, a river, an ice land, underground channels, a planet of foxes, a coast with a lighthouse, a crazy roller coaster, underground channels, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced and dynamic action requiring determination and cunning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multitude of funny weapons, e.g. egg grenade launcher, match crossbow, water pistol, spring-loaded glove... and many, many other inventions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of humor, plot twists, and surprising surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natural and artificial obstacles: water, swamps, lava, pits, traps, platforms...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and opponents of all kinds, including bosses at the end of each stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse objectives for each mission, but one main task: free your beloved!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The humorous adventures of a little rooster who must rescue his beloved and friends kidnapped by a gang of foxes. Fast-paced action in colorful 3D worlds. Various settings and worlds, funny weapons and challenging tasks. Up to 25 main levels plus extras! Cocommando needs your help — let's go!", "supported_languages": "English, Arabic, Traditional Chinese, Polish, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145830/7aeb96f0e97b6f2ece8c8636f2fbda6a54828052/header.jpg?t=1772025060", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145830/588a7882c6255866795df4ec06825872eea10fdd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772025060", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145830/588a7882c6255866795df4ec06825872eea10fdd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772025060", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 8, 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 256 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> any</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 8, 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 256 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> any</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "<strong>© LK Avalon. Wszelkie prawa zastrzeżone / All right reserved </strong><br>Wydane przez L.K. Avalon, 36-072 Świlcza 145 C, Polska na podstawie odpowiednich licencji. Wszelkie znaki handlowe i towarowe są własnością odpowiednich firm i zostały użyte wyłącznie w celach informacyjnych.<br><br>Aplikacja komputerowa Kokomando/Cocommando jest chroniona prawem autorskim. Zarówno aplikacja w całości jak i żadna z jej części nie mogą być w żaden sposób: powielane, kopiowane, pożyczane, udostępniane, wynajmowane, dystrybu